  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>  theo bảng các giá lượng giác ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>135</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên  theo bảng các giá lượng giác ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên theo bảng các giá lượng giác ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math> không xác định  và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, theo bảng các giá lượng giác ta có     <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
